opennyai_summary.facts:
Apprehending his arrest in connection with Dhanwar P.S. Case No.05 of 2024 instituted for the offences punishable under Sections 341, 323, 313, 498A, 504, 506/34 of Indian Penal Code and Section 3/4 of D.P. Act, the petitioner has moved this Court for grant of privileges of anticipatory bail.
It is next submitted that the petitioner first filed Original Suit No.89 of 2023 in the Family Court, Giridih and as an afterthought with an unexplained delay, the FIR was lodged on 07.01.2024;
only to harass the petitioner.
